Hello everyone! 

We're proud to show you the very first trailer for Lord Ambermaze, a turn-based RPG adventure with elements of dungeon crawling. This atmospheric game harkens back to classics, like The Legend of Zelda while combining dynamic battles, dangerous traps, challenges, and puzzles.

[previewyoutube=kLDoW2iGTaY;full][/previewyoutube]

Help Zane escape the mysterious labyrinth and save the world and his sister, who has been kidnapped by a dark villain. 

Lord Ambermaze is:

[list]
[*] Complex tactical battles that can't be won without a well-thought-out plan of action;
[*] Five different biomes and bosses;
[*] More than thirty enemies with their own abilities and attacks;
[*] A wide variety of locations with hiding places and challenges;
[*] Different ways of fighting, from close combat to long-range attacks, and even pushing enemies into the abyss below;
[*] A character upgrade system with various abilities to fit your playstyle;
[*] An interactive environment with advantages and disadvantages;
[*] A compelling story about siblings, evil, and the fate of the world.
[/list]

Add the game to your Steam Wishlist and join our Discord server!

Regards,
Lord Ambermaze Team
